      {
        "action_date": "2025-11-17",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Tribal Internet Expansion Act of </strong><strong>2025</strong></p><p>This bill extends to Indian country (i.e., all lands within a tribal reservation, dependent Indian communities, and tribal&nbsp;allotments) and areas with high populations of Indians the universal service principle that telecommunications and information services in rural, insular, and high-cost areas should be available at rates that are reasonably comparable to urban areas.</p>",
